  "notes": [
   "ADN4604 U79B: 16 in (IN0..IN15) and 16 out (OUT0..OUT15); the AMC/FCLK/TCLK/AMC_TX/RX pairs pass through the switch (IN + OUT pair per port).",
   "PLL0 = U85 @0x68, PLL1 = U61 @0x69 (silkscreen addresses 7'b1101_000 / 7'b1101_001).",
   "The PLL outputs loop back into the switch (PLL0/1 OUT -> IN9/IN8) and the switch can feed the PLL inputs (OUT6/OUT7).",
   "Termination: 0xF0 = 0x0F is the firmware default; the AC-coupled lines rely on the far-end 100 ohm (AMC/FMC) - to be confirmed by measurement."
  ]
 },
